{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09523","headline":"读後汉逸人传二首 一 · 张谓","name":"读後汉逸人传二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"子陵没已久，读史思其贤。\n谁谓颍阳人，千秋如比肩。\n尝闻汉皇帝，曾是旷周旋。\n名位苟无心，对君犹可眠。\n东过富春渚，乐此佳山川。\n夜卧松下月，朝看江上烟。\n钓时如有待，钓罢应忘筌。\n生事在林壑，悠悠经暮年。\n于今七里濑，遗迹尚依然。\n高台竟寂寞，流水空潺湲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张谓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09523.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09523","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}